cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when publishing research or benchmark results that use it."
type: software
title: "Linux GPU State Benchmark"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kohari"
    given-names: "Moiz"
    website: "https://github.com/mkohari"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-10-17
url: "https://github.com/mkohari/linux-gpu-state-benchmark"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mkohari/linux-gpu-state-benchmark"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An independent Linux reference benchmark by Moiz Kohari comparing language-model
  prefix recomputation with filesystem KV restoration, and synthetic Monte Carlo
  price-path recomputation with stored-state restoration and repricing. Includes
  guided setup, correctness checks and a separately scoped optional HTTP serving
  probe. No fixed speedup or vendor performance is assumed.
keywords:
  - GPU
  - KV cache
  - Linux filesystem
  - Monte Carlo
  - state reuse
  - reproducible benchmarks
